sequenceDiagram
 participant U as Upstream repo (first-contributions)
 participant F as Your fork (GitHub)
 participant L as Local clone
 U->>F: Fork
 F->>L: git clone
 L->>L: git checkout -b feature
 L->>L: edit + git commit
 L->>F: git push origin feature
 F->>U: Open pull request
 U-->>F: Review feedback
 F->>U: Push updates to same branch
 U->>U: Maintainer merges
